 "text": "Hey! How's everything today? It' a simple way to say you' welcome. People often write it after a response to say they're okay with what you said or did. Pretty much. You mix a few drops of watercolor with a little acrylic paint and blend gives you a soft, feathery wash. It' one of the easiest washes to start with. You can use it with just one shade, or mix it with inks for a harder, more dramatic effect. test sheet is always a good idea. Try mixing a few shades on a small piece and see how they work together.",
